### Id of the author to target
@id = 3

### GET all authors
GET http://localhost:3000/author

### GET an author by its id
GET http://localhost:3000/author/{{id}}

### POST Create an author
POST http://localhost:3000/author
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "lastname": "Leroux",
  "firstname": "Gaston"
}

### PATCH Update an author
PATCH http://localhost:3000/author/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "lastname": "Leroux",
  "firstname": "Gaston"
}